 "description": "Freshness status for every data source Jawz reads: per-source release date, latest observation date, expected cadence, age in days, and whether any source is stale or unavailable. Also reports whether the ingestion pipeline is keeping up, and carries plain-language notices when a scheduled update has not arrived. Applies when the reliability of a figure depends on how current its underlying data is.",
